{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Coconut is an inedible ",["l","采集","Foraged"]," ",["l","水果","Fruit"]," found in ",["l","沙漠","the Calico Desert"]," and by shaking ",["l","棕榈树","palm trees"]," on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],". It can also be bought at the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"]," on Mondays for 200g or may randomly appear in the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"],"'s stock for 300–1,000g. It can also randomly be found in ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],"s after unlocking The Desert. ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]," may also send one in the mail as a gift. The ",["l","无尽财富之雕像","Statue Of Endless Fortune"]," produces one Coconut per year on ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],"' birthday, ",["l","冬季","Winter"]," 3."]],["p",["Although it is inedible, it may be put in a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]," to make Coconut Jelly, or in a ",["l","小桶","Keg"]," to make Coconut Wine. Coconuts cannot be planted to create ",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s."]],["p",["The ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," will trade 1 ",["l","金色椰子","Golden Coconut"]," for 10 Coconuts, provided the player already previously found and cracked open at least one Golden Coconut."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Coconut is one of the options for the Crafts Room."]]]],["Recipes",2,[]],["Cooking",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff Duration"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","椰汁汤","Tom Kha Soup"]],["These flavors are incredible!"],[["i","(O)88","Coconut ×1"],["i","(O)720","Shrimp ×1"],["i","(O)404","Common Mushroom ×1"]],["Energy 175\nHealth 78"],[["l","耕种","Farming (+2)"],["l","能量","Max Energy (+30)"]],["7m"],[["l","桑迪","Sandy"]," (Mail - 7+ ❤)"],["250g"]],[[["l","热带咖喱","Tropical Curry"]],["An exotic, fragrant curry served in a pineapple bowl."],[["i","(O)88","Coconut ×1"],["i","(O)832","Pineapple ×1"],["i","(O)260","Hot Pepper ×1"]],["Energy 150\nHealth 67"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+4)"]],["5m 1s"],[["l","姜岛","Ginger Island Resort"]," for 2,000g"],["500g"]],[[["l","芒果糯米饭","Mango Sticky Rice"]],["Sweet mango and coconut transforms this rice into something very special."],[["i","(O)834","Mango ×1"],["i","(O)88","Coconut ×1"],["i","(O)423","Rice ×1"]],["Energy 113\nHealth 50"],[["l","防御","Defense (+3)"]],["5m 1s"],[["l","雷欧","Leo"]," (Mail - 7+ ❤)"],["250g"]]]]]],["Crafting",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}]]]]],["Buildings",2,[["p",["Coconuts are used to construct ",["l","沙漠图腾柱","Desert Obelisk"],"s purchased from the ",["l","法师塔","Wizard's Tower"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Cost"]},{"h":1,"v":["Size"]}],[[["l","沙漠图腾柱","Desert Obelisk"]],["Warps you to the desert."],["1,000,000g",["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×20"],["i","(O)88","Coconut ×10"],["i","(O)90","Cactus Fruit ×10"]],["3x2"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Coconut is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," with ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," in the feed to create a ",["l","裁缝","Vacation Shirt"],". It is a dark brown dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed. It can be placed in the orange dye pot at Emily's and Haley's house for use in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","格斯","Gus"]," requests a Coconut by mail on the 19th of ",["l","冬季","Winter"]," (Year 2) in the ",["l","任务","\"Exotic Spirits\" Quest"],". The reward is 600g and 1 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," heart."]],[1,["Coconut may be randomly requested after the player has completed the ",["l","收集包","Vault Bundles"]," at the ",["l","任务","\"Help Wanted\" board"]," outside ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]," for a reward of 300g and 150 ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points."]],[1,["3 Coconuts may be requested by ",["l","沙鱼","Sandfish"]," or ",["l","蝎鲤鱼","Scorpion Carp"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5."]]]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The player must reach ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," level 1 before coconuts will drop from ",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s, either shaken or chopped down."]],[1,["Normally, coconuts do not receive the +10% ",["l","技能","Tiller"]," price bonus because they are obtained by foraging (see ",["l","水果","the Fruit page"]," for details). However, coconuts obtained as gifts or purchases do, and therefore sell for 110g. If stacked with other normal quality coconuts, the entire stack will receive the price bonus."]],[1,["Botanically, the coconut is classed as a drupe, or stone fruit (other examples of Drupes are cherries and peaches)."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",["*",["l","采集","Foraging"]," in ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"],"\n*",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s in ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"]," and on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],"\n*",["l","绿洲","Oasis"]]],["Season",["All"]],["Sell Price",["100g"]]]}